<title>UK: London Tea Auction price indications.</title>
<headline>London Tea Auction price indications.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>At today's London landed Tea Auction of 8,643 packages of 53.50 kgs, including 3,800 offshore, price indications in pence a kilo compared to the last sale and the corresponding week last year.</p>
<p>    Best available  175     (181     and 142)</p>
<p>    Good		170     (170     and 130)</p>
<p>    Good Medium     155     (157     and 121)</p>
<p>    Medium	    147     (150     and 112)</p>
<p>    Low Medium	100 nom (100 nom and  90 nom)</p>
<p>The highest price paid was 175 pence for a Kenyan PF.1</p>
</text>
